  "details": "- CVE-2026-93990: reject a UTF-16 high surrogate that is not followed by a low\n  surrogate, by adding LITTLE2_/BIG2_IS_INVALID_CHAR and the matching\n  little2_/big2_isInvalid4 vtable entries to the UTF-16 tokenizers in\n  lib/xmltok.c, so a lone high surrogate can no longer consume the following\n  code unit as a fake low surrogate and hide markup from the parser",
